# tccompare must also compare the length of both strings
Wyjście pisz: (['secret'] tccompare: ['']), nowa-linia.
Wyjście pisz: ([''] tccompare: ['secret']), nowa-linia.
Wyjście pisz: (['secret'] tccompare: ['sec']), nowa-linia.
Wyjście pisz: (['sec'] tccompare: ['secret']), nowa-linia.
Wyjście pisz: (['secret'] tccompare: ['secret']), nowa-linia.
Wyjście pisz: ([''] tccompare: ['']), nowa-linia.
